    💭 🧂: the key that names are hashed with
    👌 check 🔤the hash key is the same every time it is asked for🔤 🤜🧂🐇🔩 0❗️ 🙌 🧂🐇🔩 0❗️🤛 🤝 🤜🧂🐇🔩 1❗️ 🙌 🧂🐇🔩 1❗️🤛❗️
    👌 check 🔤it was drawn at random: neither half is zero, and they differ🔤 ❎ 🤜🧂🐇🔩 0❗️ 🙌 0 👐 🧂🐇🔩 1❗️ 🙌 0 👐 🧂🐇🔩 0❗️ 🙌 🧂🐇🔩 1❗️🤛❗️❗️
    👌 check 🔤asking for any other half gives one of the two🔤 🤜🧂🐇🔩 2❗️ 🙌 🧂🐇🔩 0❗️🤛 🤝 🤜🧂🐇🔩 -1❗️ 🙌 🧂🐇🔩 1❗️🤛❗️

    💭 🗝: names and the places they hold
    🆕🗝❗️ ➡️ table
    🔢 check 🔤a new table holds no names🔤 📏 table❓ 0❗️
    🔢 check 🔤and finds none🔤 🔍 table 🔤a🔤❗️ -1❗️
    🔢 check 🔤the first name added takes place 0🔤 🐻 table 🔤a🔤❗️ 0❗️
    🔢 check 🔤the next takes place 1🔤 🐻 table 🔤b🔤❗️ 1❗️
    🔢 check 🔤the empty name is a name🔤 🐻 table 🔤🔤❗️ 2❗️
    🔢 check 🔤names differ by case🔤 🐻 table 🔤A🔤❗️ 3❗️
    🔢 check 🔤a name may be any text🔤 🐻 table 🔤café 🍇🔤❗️ 4❗️
    🔢 check 🔤adding a name again gives the place it has🔤 🐻 table 🔤b🔤❗️ 1❗️
    🔢 check 🔤and adds nothing🔤 📏 table❓ 5❗️
    🔢 check 🔤a name is found at its place🔤 🔍 table 🔤café 🍇🔤❗️ 4❗️
    🔢 check 🔤the empty name too🔤 🔍 table 🔤🔤❗️ 2❗️
    🔢 check 🔤a name that was never added is not found🔤 🔍 table 🔤c🔤❗️ -1❗️
    🔢 check 🔤and looking for it adds nothing🔤 📏 table❓ 5❗️
    🔡 check 🔤the names come back in the order they were added🔤 🆕🔡 🐙 table❗️ 🔤|🔤❗️ 🔤a|b||A|café 🍇🔤❗️

