    🔢 check 🔤the first name is still at place 0🔤 🔍 grown 🔤n0🔤❗️ 0❗️
    🔢 check 🔤the eighth is still at place 7🔤 🔍 grown 🔤n7🔤❗️ 7❗️
    🔢 check 🔤the ninth is found🔤 🔍 grown 🔤n8🔤❗️ 8❗️
